Package: Batz
Title: Bat Acoustic Data Processing and Reporting
Version: 0.0.0.9006
Authors@R:
    person("Joshua", "Guilbert", , "josh.guilbert@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Streamlines the conversion of outputs from various programs
    (Sonobat, Kpro and Survey123) and acoustic recording devices (Wildlife
    Acoustics) in CSV, text or Excel format, and processes the data into
    the standardized forms and charts for reporting.
